From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:09:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] updater: check this fork's GitHub releases for
 -harmony-preview builds

The stock updater asks api.github.com for komikku-app/anikku-preview's
releases and only understands "r1234" / "v0.1.2" version strings, so a
build versioned 0.2.0-harmony.1 would either crash the parser
(NumberFormatException on "0.2.0.1") or be offered the official APK, which
cannot be installed over an APK signed with a different key.

- AppUpdateChecker: GITHUB_REPO is Xun2202/anikku-harmony for every build
  type; RELEASE_TAG is derived from VERSION_NAME as
  v<ver>-harmony-preview.<N> (used by the About screen / release links).
- GetApplicationRelease: compare (major, minor, patch, harmony) tuples
  parsed from "(\d+)\.(\d+)\.(\d+)-harmony(?:-preview)?\.(\d+)"; a harmony
  build never accepts a non-harmony tag. The upstream comparison is kept as
  fallback with toIntOrNull() so an unexpected tag cannot crash the app.
- ReleaseServiceImpl needs no change: Anikku already lists /releases and
  picks the first non-prerelease entry, so fork releases must be published
  as regular (non-prerelease) releases with -arm64-v8a / universal assets.
